Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:38.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗斯福收容所 罗克福德 伊利诺斯州）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.85,0:05:01.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟离开屋子 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your brother outside as fast as you can! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他想让我们继续他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拯救人类 猎杀恶魔 家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving people, hunting things.Family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得妈妈想让我们这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Mom would have wanted this for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我无法一个人完成 - 我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't do this alone. - l'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们总是不听话闯进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't keep kids out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那又怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.29,0:01:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我忘了你不是本地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}l forgot you're not local.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你不知道这个传说 - 传说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know the legend. - Legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个小镇都有自己的传说 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every town's got its stories, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的就是这罗斯福收容所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ours is Roosevelt Asylum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说这里有病人的鬼魂出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say it's haunted with the ghosts of the patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里过夜 鬼魂会把你逼疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend the night, the spirits will drive you insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗 警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Police officers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.87,0:01:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police officers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:01:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些孩子带着断线钳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You telling me these kids brought bolt cutters?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们分头找\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.17,0:02:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.45,0:03:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯莉 听到请回话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠 你去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez.Where the hell you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.95,0:03:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么 看到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it? See anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是巡逻1- 4 任务完成 正往回赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is patrol 1-4. We are clear and returning to station.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗杰 巡逻1- 4\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Patrol 1-4…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 你还是不和我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}, what? You're still not talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔特 我为以前所做的道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walt, I said I was sorry about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要我说多少遍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 上次我们收到信 他还在加州\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dad was in California last we heard from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只是想 他会来找你要军火\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just thought that he comes to you for munitions…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你在最近几个星期见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you seen him in the last few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 如果你听到什么一定要告诉我 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call us if you hear anything - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯尔博也没有他的消息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caleb hasn't heard from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰斐逊和吉姆牧师也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Neither has Jefferson or Pastor Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在日记里发现什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the journal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any leads in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 和我上次翻过一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Same last time I looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我什么也找不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I can make out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢这个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.19,0:05:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓他有点象「尤达」大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he writes like Yoda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们该去找联邦调查局 贴出寻人启事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should call the feds. File a missing persons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸如果知道我们让联邦调查局介入 他会发怒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talked about this. Dad would be pissed if we put the feds on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在堪萨斯州发生的那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. After all that happened back in Kansas…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他当时应该在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said so yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你试着打给他可什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的手机在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is my cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 根据我们现在情况他可能死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he could be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不准这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没有死 他只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dead.He's-He's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}躲了起来？他很忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hiding? He's busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个短消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a A text message.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个坐标值\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得爸爸在考验我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Dad was texting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他以前也给过我们坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's given us coordinates before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个消息没什么值得庆祝的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can barely work a toaster, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 这是个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, this is good news. It means he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这意味着他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or alive, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还活着 发消息的人有电话号码吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a number on the caller ID?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面的显示是「不明」\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it said unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那么坐标点在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do the coordinates point?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是有趣的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the interesting part.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗克福德 伊利诺斯州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rockford, lllinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 这有趣在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and that's interesting how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查了下罗克福德当地的报纸 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked the local Rockford paper. Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.19,0:06:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个警察沃尔特 凯莉 轮班回家后\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cop, Walter Kelly, he comes home from his shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.11,0:06:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}射杀了他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoots his wife…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后把枪对着自己的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}then puts the gun in his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把脑子都轰了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blows his brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当天晚上早些时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earlier that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯莉和搭档接到 让他们去罗斯福收容所的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly and his partner responded to a call at Roosevelt Asylum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是不能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, l'm not following.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这和我们有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does this have to do with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.52,0:06:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸在日记里给同样的收容所打上了标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad earmarked the same asylum in the journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里七人目击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Seven unconfirmed sightings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到上周 至少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till last week, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这就是他想让我们去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is where he wants us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是个工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸只是想让我们去完成它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad wants us to work a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 也许我们能见到他 也许他就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe we'll meet up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也许只是想让我们去猎鬼而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be sending us there by ourselves to hunt this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁管呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他希望我们去那里 这对我来说就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf he wants us there, it's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不让你奇怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't strike you as weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}考验 坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}The texting? The coordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸叫我们去那里 我们就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's telling us to go somewhere. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 你就是丹尼尔·冈德森 对吧 警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Daniel Gunderson, right? You're a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.01,0:07:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是芝加哥报的奈杰尔·塔夫诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Nigel Tufnel, with the Chicago Tribune.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不介意我问一些关于你搭档的问题吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I ask a couple questions about your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只想在这里喝瓶啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to have a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想听听你说说这故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't take that long. I just wanna hear your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一星期前 我的搭档就坐在这个位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week ago my partner was sitting in that chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是故意在这里等我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna ambush me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 我只想知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I need to know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy. How about leaving the guy alone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可是个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's an officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不表现得尊重一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you show a little respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不必那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我得那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那家伙是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy's a serious jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我请你喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me buy you a beer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在那推我可够猛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoved me kind of hard in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得那么做 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}l had to sell it, didn't l?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是情景表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Method acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从冈德森查到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you find out from Gunderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔特 凯莉是个好警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter Kelly was a good cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经是个小头头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head of his class, evenkeeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且前途一片光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a bright future ahead of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.69,0:08:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他家里呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:08:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和老婆常常吵些小架\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and his wife had a few fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但日子还算平稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was mostly smooth sailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们甚至考虑过要孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were talking about having kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以凯莉要么是忍不住爆发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either Kelly had some crazy waiting to bust out…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.39,0:09:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是另有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}or something did it to him. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于收容所 冈德森说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd Gunderson tell you about the asylum?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很明显 警察追捕孩子来到了这\N{\fnArial\fs30}So apparently, the cops chased the kids here…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进入房子的南向的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the south wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南向的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}South wing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南向的房间 南向的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}South wing, south wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1972年三个孩子进到南向的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}1 972."Three kids broke into the south wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一个活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one survived."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:09:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way he tells it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的一个朋友发疯 开始放火焚烧房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of his friends went nuts and started lighting up the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以无论是发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南向的房间看来是问题的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}South wing seems like the heart of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果孩子们来这收容所探险的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if kids are spelunking the asylum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么他们会没事呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't there a ton more deaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来这门常常被锁着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the doors are usually chained.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许锁上有好些年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could've been chained up for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}防止人类进去 或让某东西进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, to keep people out. Or to keep something in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你看到死人的话 海利·乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know if you see any dead people, Haley Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 玩笑开够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得小心点哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be careful, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鬼怪们都被你身上类似ESP（鬼魂的感应装置）的东西所吸引\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts are attracted to that ESP thing you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你 这不是ESP\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, it's not ESP.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.50,0:10:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时我只是有预感 奇怪的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have strange vibes sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论怎么样 不需要的话就不必说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird dreams. Yeah, whatever. Don't ask, don't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你用那个东西发现些什么没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You getting any reading on that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 当然它并不意味着没人在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. It doesn't mean nobody's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.47,0:10:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些时候鬼魂并不显身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirits can't appear during certain hours of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些家伙在晚上出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaks come out at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便问问这中间你认为谁最变态啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hey, who's the hotter psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帕特丽夏·阿奎特爱上休伊特的珍妮弗还是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patricia Arquette, Jennifer Love Hewitt or you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.03,0:11:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.36,0:11:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}电击疗法 脑叶切开术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Electroshock, lobotomies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们对这些病人的确做痛苦的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did some twisted stuff to these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对象我这样的人 在「布谷鸟的巢穴」的Jack\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like my man Jack in Cuckoo's Nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对此你怎么看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鬼魂控制了人类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts are possessing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许更象是在阴宅或者幻觉辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe it's more like Like Amityville or the Smurl haunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鬼魂把他们避疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirits driving them insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对就象我这样的人 「闪光中的」杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like my man Jack in The Shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:11:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.77,0:12:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们什么时候才谈谈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are we gonna talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谈什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸不在这里的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the fact that Dad's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我想想 永远别提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, let's see. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是认真的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm being serious, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.35,0:12:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是 萨姆 他派我们来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am l, Sam. He sent us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他明显想要我们来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He obviously wants us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必要要来这里搜索情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll pick up the search later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.93,0:12:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想要怎么样并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt doesn't matter what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看 就是你这样的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that attitude right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.35,0:12:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是为什么老爸从小对我好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why I always got the extra cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸也许正在危险中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad could be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该是去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.70,0:12:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要找到答案 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We deserve answers, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是我们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.61,0:12:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能理解 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这是他给我们的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's given us an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们就必须遵守这个命令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta always follow Dad's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然我们必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须要查出关于南向房间的更多情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what we gotta do. We gotta find out more about the south wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看是否真有事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if something happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆·温彻斯特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.07,0:13:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你给我最好一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for seeing me last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃利科特医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Ellicott?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃利科特 这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellicott, that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有位桑福德·埃利科特吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't there a? A Dr. Sanford Ellicott?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他好象是位精神病学的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he was a chief psychiatrist somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲原来是老罗斯福收容所的院长\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was chief of staff at the old Roosevelt Asylum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.52,0:13:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是个对当地历史比较感兴趣的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, l'm sort of a localhistory buff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那所医院 有事故或其它什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wasn't there a Wasn't there an incident or something? In the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜在南边的房子里 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}l guess. In the south wing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我们在花你的钱 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on your dollar, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在这里是在谈论你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to talk about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 是的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay. Yeah, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 现在怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So. So. How's things?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都好 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, things are good, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你在做什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, same old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和哥哥在汽车旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just been on a road trip with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那有趣吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.99,0:14:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们遇到了很多 有趣的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met a lot of…interesting people. Mmhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做了很多 很多有趣的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did a lot of… A lot of interesting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.70,0:14:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在南向房子里 究竟发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it exactly that happened in the south wing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是忘记需要提醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 如果你热心于当地的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're a local-history buff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那关于罗斯福收容所的骚乱 你不可能不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know all about the Roosevelt riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骚乱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The riot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.53,0:14:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我知道 我只是好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, I know. I'm just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我们别在逗圈子了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Let's cut the bull, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在逃避议题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're avoiding the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:14:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么议题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What subject?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们做个买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, l'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就告诉你那场罗斯福收容所骚乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you all about the Roosevelt riot…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你诚实的告诉我你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you tell me something honest about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如你可以说说和你一起汽车旅行的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, this brother you're road-tripping with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.67,0:15:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对他怎么想的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.78,0:15:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在那里待了有一辈子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们究竟在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell were you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医学的问话 你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the hospital, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有？还有南向的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And? And the south wing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.82,0:15:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里是他们关最棘手的人的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where they housed the real hard cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精神病 发狂的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The psychotics, the criminally insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来不错哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在64年的一天晚上 他们发动了骚乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And one night in '64, they rioted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.40,0:15:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}袭击医生 也互相袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attacked staff, attacked each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此病人控制了收容所\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the patients took over the asylum?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 很显然 - 有人死了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Apparently. - Any deaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一些病人 也有医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some patients, some staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜想当时一定非常血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it was pretty gory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些人的尸体一直没被找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the bodies were never even recovered…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}包括院长埃利科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}including our chief of staff, Ellicott.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.21,0:15:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「没被找到」什么意思？警察搜遍了整个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never recovered? Cops scoured every inch of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我猜想病人把他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I guess the patients must've…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藏到了某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}stuffed the bodies somewhere hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那太狠了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's grim. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他们把所有活着的病人都转移了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they transferred all the surviving patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并关闭了收容所\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shut down the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.87,0:16:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这里有暴力死亡和未发现的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we've got violent deaths and unrecovered bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.79,0:16:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这意味着那有着一群鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which could mean angry spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们晚上再去那里查查看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's check out the hospital tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我们在看电影一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were going to a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比那个感觉更真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就像是在电影里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we're in a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信这就是你对我说的约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you call this a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 会很好玩的 让我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it'll be fun. Let's look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 我们去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.73,0:17:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在这等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.14,0:17:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加文 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}W Gavin, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只过去一小会\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm just gonna be a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里没什么的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's gonna get you, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 不是很害怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetie. Couldn't take it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加文 你在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么显示吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting readings?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来有大件事要发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个地方看来疯子成群\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is orbing like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这周围一定有好多鬼魂出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably spirits out and about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些没发现的尸体就是因为鬼魂出没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If these bodies are causing the haunting…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去找到并烧了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find them and burn them. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次让我紧张的 不是愤怒的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only thing that makes me more nervous than a pissed-off spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是愤怒的心理变态的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the pissed-off spirit of a psycho killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霰弹枪迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shotgun!Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霰弹枪 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shotgun! Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.89,0:21:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 就你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是指她并不是要袭击我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was weird that she didn't attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我刚才的位置她没有任何暴力动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked pretty agro from where I was standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她没伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她甚至都没有那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't even try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.43,0:21:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她不想伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if she didn't want to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.41,0:21:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她想做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what did she want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事 我们不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. We're not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.27,0:21:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.17,0:21:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:21:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的迪恩 这是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm Dean. This is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在这里干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.37,0:22:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我男朋友加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, my boyfriend, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.33,0:22:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.10,0:22:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他觉得来看看鬼魂也许比较有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought it would be fun and try and see some ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.75,0:22:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原以为这不过是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was all just…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.45,0:22:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 假装的恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.39,0:22:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我看到了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也听到加文在大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard Gavin scream and…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 凯特来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Kat, come on. Sam's gonna get you out…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.11,0:22:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆会带你出去 然后我们去找你男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll find your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没找到加文 我不会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave without Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.86,0:22:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和你们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.12,0:22:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no joke around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.17,0:22:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.22,0:22:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也是我为什么去找的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I've gotta find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那我们分头去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I guess we're gonna split up, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.57,0:22:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.40,0:22:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.65,0:22:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.30,0:23:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.45,0:23:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.29,0:23:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定看过很多恐怖电影 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen a lot of horror movies, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.45,0:23:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}l guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我个忙 下次你再看的时候 注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor. Next time you see one, pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.75,0:23:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有人说某地鬼魂出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}When someone says a place is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千万不要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.11,0:23:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.82,0:23:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.19,0:23:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.67,0:23:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.22,0:23:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们找到你女朋友 凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found your girlfriend. Kat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.73,0:23:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. ls she all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.20,0:23:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.53,0:23:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.60,0:23:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拼命的跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was running.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.13,0:23:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你要跑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were running from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.19,0:23:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.15,0:23:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她 她的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.24,0:23:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都有点搞混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt was all messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.78,0:24:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 听着 这女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Listen, listen.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.18,0:24:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她想伤害你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}his girl, did she try to hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.23,0:24:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.01,0:24:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. She…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.93,0:24:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.41,0:24:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她亲了我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}She kissed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.79,0:24:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她并没有伤害你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… But- But she didn't hurt you physically?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.27,0:24:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 她只是亲了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, she kissed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.95,0:24:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scarred for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.53,0:24:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 事情可能比你想的要糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, trust me, it could've been worse. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.02,0:24:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在还记得其它的什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.91,0:24:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.84,0:24:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 她想和我悄悄说点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, she tried to whisper something in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.39,0:24:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.98,0:24:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道 我吓得跑的飞快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I ran like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.67,0:24:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.15,0:24:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事 我有打火机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I got a lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.07,0:24:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你弄疼我的胳膊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. You're hurting my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.09,0:24:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.92,0:25:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.34,0:25:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放我出去 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kat, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.13,0:25:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么了？- 她被一个魂抓进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - She's with one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.95,0:25:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 救我 - 凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me! - Kat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.05,0:25:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特 他不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kat.It's not gonna hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.49,0:25:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说 你必须冷静面对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me! You have to face it.You have to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.53,0:25:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gotta what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.58,0:26:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}l have to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精神 他们不会伤害我们 他们只是想交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirits. They're not hurting us.They're trying to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.33,0:26:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得面对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.10,0:26:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来面对试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You face it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.00,0:26:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你出去的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's the only way to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.30,0:26:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看着他 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.51,0:26:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 你能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.39,0:26:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.23,0:26:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I hope you're right about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我也希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Kat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.36,0:26:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 137 - 你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One thirty-seven. - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.86,0:27:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让它在我的耳边低声说 1 37\N{\fnArial\fs30}It whispered in my ear, 1 37.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.90,0:27:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房间号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room number.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.41,0:27:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这些鬼魂不是想伤害人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if these spirits aren't trying to hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.17,0:27:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么他们想干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are they trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.95,0:27:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这就是他们想告诉我们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they've been trying to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.39,0:27:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我们会找出答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.15,0:27:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们准备好离开这里了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… Now, you guys ready to leave this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不用说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.67,0:27:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 你带他们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.70,0:27:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去找137号房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go find room 1 37.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.42,0:27:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们怎么知道鬼魂这类东西的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do you guys know about all this ghost stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.53,0:27:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.44,0:27:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人是为了什么理由做这样的工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would anyone want a job like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.81,0:27:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个蹩脚的家伙指挥我们这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a crappy guidance counselor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.07,0:27:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.35,0:27:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是你的老板？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.63,0:28:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.64,0:28:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.87,0:28:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我们有问题要解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think we have a small problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.10,0:28:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们打开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.32,0:28:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这不太可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't think that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.55,0:28:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么从窗户呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.36,0:28:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们也被钉死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're barred.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.14,0:28:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们怎么出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how are we supposed to get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.70,0:28:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.57,0:28:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.97,0:28:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有着某种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.34,0:29:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不想让我们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't want us to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.92,0:29:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些病人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.63,0:29:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.35,0:29:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.26,0:29:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我为什么每次都能拿大奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why I get paid the big bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.39,0:29:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「病人日记」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patients journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.01,0:30:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃利科特医生没日没夜的工作 让他心理有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why all work and no play makes Dr. Ellicott a very dull boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.61,0:30:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把这周围都看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. l've looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.56,0:30:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no other way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.06,0:30:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.42,0:30:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先我们不能恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.92,0:30:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.06,0:30:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sam, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.48,0:30:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.29,0:30:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在向我走来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.50,0:30:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.45,0:30:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 在地下室 快点 - 我马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in the basement. Hurry! - l'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.11,0:30:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们谁会用霰弹枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Can either of you handle a shotgun?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.98,0:30:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.33,0:30:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我行\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.83,0:30:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爸带我去打过几次双向飞碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad took me skeet shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.71,0:30:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里面装的是盐块\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.82,0:30:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它可能杀不了鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's loaded with rock salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.80,0:30:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但能驱散它们 如果你看到什么就射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll repel a spirit. So if you see something, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.47,0:30:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.16,0:30:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.58,0:31:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.49,0:32:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.82,0:32:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.43,0:32:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会让你感觉更舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to make you all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.79,0:32:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Gavin?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.58,0:32:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.98,0:33:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们能活着出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we make it out of here alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.95,0:33:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们马上就分手\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are so breaking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.98,0:33:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.22,0:33:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么东西过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.97,0:33:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他妈的 他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.80,0:33:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别开枪 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot…it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.74,0:33:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.34,0:33:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们还在这里干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.83,0:33:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.02,0:33:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他去了地下室 你给他打过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to the basement. You called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.33,0:33:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没联系他\N{\fnArial\fs30}l didn't call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.31,0:33:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他手机响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cell phone rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.68,0:33:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说是你打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.67,0:33:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地下室？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basement, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.02,0:33:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.93,0:33:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保护自己 也注意下是不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch yourselves. And watch out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.55,0:33:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.98,0:33:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你在这吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.12,0:34:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.45,0:34:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.65,0:34:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.18,0:34:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫你的时候回一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me when l'm calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.32,0:34:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.14,0:34:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.13,0:34:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你知道那不是我打过来的 - 是 我知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That wasn't me who called your cell. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.59,0:34:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是什么东西想引诱我下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think something lured me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.71,0:34:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我知道是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think I know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.15,0:34:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃利科特医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Ellicott.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.50,0:34:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是鬼魂们想和我们说的 你有没有看到他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the spirits have been saying. You haven't seen him, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.90,0:34:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.86,0:34:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道是他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know it was him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我找到了他的日志\N{\fnArial\fs30}l found his log book.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.31,0:34:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很明显 他在拿他的病人做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he was experimenting on his patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怕的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some awful stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.28,0:34:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他眼里施行脑叶切开术 就跟吃阿斯匹林一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes lobotomies look like aspirin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.03,0:34:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是病人自己骚乱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was the patients who rioted.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.00,0:34:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们因为反对埃利科特医生才骚乱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they were rioting against Dr. Ellicott.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.71,0:34:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}院长在研究某种 超过人体限度的治疗方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Feelgood was working on some sort of, like, extreme rage therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.47,0:34:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他以为如果他能让他的病人 释放出他们的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought if he could get his patients to vent their anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.53,0:34:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们就会被治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd be cured of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.20,0:34:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相反这让他们情况越来越糟糕 也越来越愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, it only made them worse and worse, and angrier and angrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.91,0:34:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在想 为什么他的鬼魂在做同样的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking, what if his spirit is doing the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.10,0:34:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对那个警察 70年代的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the cop. To the kids in the '70s.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.64,0:34:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他们怒气疼腾腾以至于杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making them so angry, they become homicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.19,0:34:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.10,0:34:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得找到他的尸骨烧了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find his bones and torch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.38,0:34:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.59,0:34:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察都没找到他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police never found his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.01,0:35:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那本日志说在这下面有间秘密的手术室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The log book said he had a hidden procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.60,0:35:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用来对他的病人实施「治疗」\N{\fnArial\fs30}room down here somewhere…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.42,0:35:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以如果我是个病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he'd work on his patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.61,0:35:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把他弄到那里 然后以其人之道还其人之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was a patient, l'd drag his ass down, do a little work on it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.11,0:35:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 听上去有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know. It sounds kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.50,0:35:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 很疯狂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.32,0:35:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.25,0:35:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你我什么地方都找过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.62,0:35:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没找到密室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't find a hidden room.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.54,0:35:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是他们说的被藏了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they call it hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.22,0:35:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听到那个了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.58,0:35:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.43,0:35:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有个门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a door here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.01,0:35:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.37,0:36:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离这门远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back from the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.87,0:36:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.66,0:36:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是命令吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls that an order?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.50,0:36:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}友好的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's more of a friendly request.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.16,0:36:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经厌倦了你的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm getting pretty tired of taking your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.06,0:36:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.78,0:36:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃利科特控制了你 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellicott did something to you, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.69,0:36:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.64,0:36:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请闭上你的臭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.50,0:36:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要做什么 萨姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.37,0:36:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这把枪里装的是盐块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun's filled with rock salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.18,0:36:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它杀不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.70,0:36:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.71,0:36:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但它会让你痛的要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it'll hurt like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.53,0:36:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我们得烧了埃利科特尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! We gotta burn Ellicott's bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.63,0:36:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后这一切都会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all this'll be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.03,0:36:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也会恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.67,0:36:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.74,0:36:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我第一次说出事实真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just telling the truth for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.86,0:36:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么我们在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why are we even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.41,0:37:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为你像个小兵一样乖乖的听老爸的命令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're following Dad's orders like a good soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.17,0:37:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以为你总是听从他的命令而没有疑问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you always do what he says without question?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.97,0:37:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于他你就那么奋不顾身？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're that desperate for his approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.46,0:37:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是你本意 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you talking, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.83,0:37:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你我的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the difference between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.42,0:37:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有自己的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a mind of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.48,0:37:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不象你那么可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not pathetic like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.46,0:37:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.62,0:37:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经厌倦了按你的话去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I am sick of doing what you tell me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.92,0:37:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六个月前我们根本没有靠近过爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're no closer to finding Dad today than we were six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.82,0:37:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 那就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.22,0:37:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我释放你的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make it easier for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.33,0:37:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.33,0:37:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.59,0:37:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的子弹比盐块好用多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real bullets are gonna work a hell of a lot better than rock salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.63,0:37:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.45,0:37:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就那么恨我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hate me that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.62,0:37:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得你能对你哥哥下手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you could kill your own brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.27,0:37:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.98,0:38:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扣动扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.35,0:38:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开枪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.19,0:38:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 我才不会给你有子弹的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, l'm not gonna give you a loaded pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.96,0:38:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.65,0:39:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's just gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.24,0:39:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撒上油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, soak it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.21,0:40:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.46,0:40:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.09,0:40:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会让你感觉更舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to make you all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.89,0:41:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会杀我的 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna try to kill me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.76,0:41:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.82,0:41:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那听起来也很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that would be awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.80,0:41:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.21,0:41:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.85,0:41:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别再来闹鬼的收容所了 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more haunted asylums, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.23,0:41:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.65,0:41:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.44,0:41:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在那里面的时候说了很多可怕的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said some awful things back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.97,0:41:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你都记得？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.52,0:41:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.25,0:41:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎是我不能控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I couldn't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.85,0:41:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我不是故意说 那些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't mean it, any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.04,0:41:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不想那样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.94,0:41:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 当然我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.93,0:41:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要再继续谈论这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we need to talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.50,0:42:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 我才不在乎那些情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm not really in the sharing and caring kind of mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.88,0:42:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我只想睡大觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.72,0:42:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.25,0:42:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.96,0:42:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
